    <moqui.math.ParameterDef parameterDefId="PD_LEVEL_LOW_LOW_THRESHOLD" parameterTypeEnumId="PtNumberDecimal" purposeEnumId="PpFeedback" parameterCode="SIG.004" parameterName="LevelLowLowThreshold" description="Not a physical signal. Modeled through the signal-catalog mechanism only because the current tooling has no separate path to mint a free-standing supervisory ParameterDef/Parameter outside an atomic component or a physical I/O signal (signal.device_id must be an elementary device, not the root DeviceGroup); direction=input/ purpose=PpFeedback is the closest available fit, not a literal claim of wired I/O. Renders as dev.levelControllerLevelLowLowThreshold (named &quot;LowLow&quot; rather than &quot;LL&quot; to avoid ambiguous consecutive-capital camelCase tokenization in the generator). Tuned value (5%, developer-confirmed) is set via device-config-survey.yaml, not this base seed default." />
